  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a9f96ae2e70c246b8ab5d7d9a21ebd3a, type: 3}
  m_Name: TutorialDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueSO
  defaultSprite: {fileID: -8514442416809331602, guid: 4146395592bfe468c8dd22c3b3a78930, type: 3}
  Lines:
  - expression: {fileID: -8514442416809331602, guid: 4146395592bfe468c8dd22c3b3a78930, type: 3}
    text: So you're the new kid, eh?
  - expression: {fileID: -7715413057357343216, guid: c3d53961d60484283af3c0d6916884e2, type: 3}
    text: Welcome to the job. You'll be working as a transit overseer.
  - expression: {fileID: -8514442416809331602, guid: 4146395592bfe468c8dd22c3b3a78930, type: 3}
    text: When a station turns <color="yellow">YELLOW</color>, trouble is occuring.
  - expression: {fileID: 0}
    text: <b>CLICK AND DRAG</b> similar problems to fix them.
  - expression: {fileID: 0}
    text: Leave a problem hanging and a <color="red">DELAY</color> happens! People
      <b>HATE</b> delays!
  - expression: {fileID: 8370624162599242350, guid: 160c34cf388d44c03a163c50a18630bd, type: 3}
    text: Once your reputation takes a hit, it's one and done...
  - expression: {fileID: 0}
    text: It ain't an easy job so try to survive while you're at it.
  - expression: {fileID: -7715413057357343216, guid: c3d53961d60484283af3c0d6916884e2, type: 3}
    text: I'll be your supervisor. I'm a also a goat btw.
